      "sourceTextSha256": "82730332ae32ce6fe152ae18a9d17840b632769bdc353b3e595ea8fda9b36f79",
      "text": "10 February · Tour of the Brazilian side of the falls with an English-speaking guide. Their name means “big water” in Guaraní: the falls thunder down up to about 80 metres into the Devil’s Throat gorge, in striking contrast to the calm river above.\n\n**Macuco Safari**\n\nOptional\n\nPrice on request.\n\n**Bird Park**\n\nOptional\n\nPrice on request.\n\n**Helicopter over the falls**\n\nOptional\n\nPrice on request.",
